    "enUS": {
      "description": "I would ask one last favor while I have you here, friend. Could you deliver the poultice I have made to two of my companions here in camp?\r\n\r\nEnho is in our infirmary to the left. He is very weak but I yet hope he will be able to overcome the infection. I have been spoon-feeding him broth to try to help him regain his strength.\r\n\r\nThe other is Maruke.\r\n\r\n<Ortak hangs his head in silence for a moment.>\r\n\r\nYou will find her north of here, where we keep the few mounts we have left.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Poultice Delivered to Enho",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Poultice Delivered to Maruke",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Deliver the Hyjal Silphium Poultice to Enho and Maruke.",
